<title>RUSSIA: Rouble edges up to 3,554.50 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble edges up to 3,554.50 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged up to 3,554.50 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,555.00 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 15		  Oct 14</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,554.50		3,555.00</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    0.45		    0.97</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
